# Semotics of AI in Job Market

This page applies Semiotics and the study that shows how people develop meaning using words and symbols. In searching for a job, words such as “experience,” “entry-level,” and “competitive” will help a person get a feel of the nature of the job just by looking at a few words. The AI uses such words in job postings in order to attract the attention of people and make them click on the job listing.
